message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "LGBTQ+ Labor-Market Gaps in Chile"
version: "1.0.0"

authors:
  - family-names: "Gálvez Espinoza"
    given-names: "Ignacio Alfonso"
    affiliation: "Universidad de Chile"

  - family-names: "Valenzuela Alvarado"
    given-names: "Cristian Rodolfo"
    affiliation: "Universidad de Chile"

abstract: >-
  Replication code for the analysis of labor-market and earnings gaps
  by gender identity and sexual orientation in Chile. Includes CASEN
  analyses, a reconstruction of Nettuno (2024), and complementary
  estimates using the INE Web Survey on Sexual and Gender Diversity.

repository-code: "https://github.com/Ignacio-Ga/lgbtq-labor-market-gaps-chile"

keywords:
  - LGBTQ+
  - Chile
  - CASEN
  - labor market
  - wage gaps
  - gender identity
  - sexual orientation

